:R-HSA-4615885  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "The sliding clamp protein PCNA, Aurora-A, Aurora-B, Borealin, and various topoisomerases can be SUMOylated (reviewed in Wan et al. 2012). SUMOylation of PCNA appears to reduce formation of double-strand breaks and inappropriate recombination (reviewed in Watts 2006, Watts 2007, Dieckman et al. 2012, Gazy and Kupiec 2012). SUMOylation of Aurora-A, Aurora-B, and Borealin is necessary for proper chromosome segregation. SUMOylation of topoisomerases is observed in response to damage caused by inhibitors of topoisomerases." ;
        rdfs:label          "SUMOylation of DNA replication proteins" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Authored: May, B, 2013-09-21" , "Reviewed: Zhang, Xiang-Dong, 2015-10-04" , "Edited: May, B, 2013-09-21" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
        pav:providedBy      "https://reactome.org" ;
        oboInOwl:hasDbXref  "R-HSA-4615885" ;
        skos:narrower       <http://model.geneontology.org/R-HSA-3108232/R-HSA-3108232> ;
        skos:note           "org.biopax.paxtools.model.level3.Pathway" .

